pele.js is Pele, Obsidian's Mermaid renderer, copied unchanged. pele.d.ts
gathers the part of its declarations the mod uses. Neither is covered by the
MIT License in the root LICENSE file: Pele keeps its own license, below.

| File | Source | Version | License |
|---|---|---|---|
| pele.js | https://github.com/obsidianmd/pele, npm package `pele` | 1.9.0 | MIT, (c) 2026 kepano |
| pele.d.ts | the same package's dist/*.d.ts, trimmed to render and PeleError | 1.9.0 | MIT, (c) 2026 kepano |

pele.js is the package's dist/pele.js, an ES module with no imports, made by:

    npm pack pele@1.9.0
    tar -xzf pele-1.9.0.tgz package/dist/pele.js
    cp package/dist/pele.js mods/diagrams/vendor/pele.js

Its SHA-256 is 7c40a25eeaf4370fb56c03d9d8f6780051c9c39b6c6ca36d53239075117097f5.
To update it, run the same commands with the new version, then
`claude plugin test mods/diagrams`.

